cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  ifba-a11y: accessibility evaluation suite for the institutional portal of the
  Instituto Federal de Educação, Ciência e Tecnologia da Bahia
message: >-
  If you use this software or the dataset it produced, please cite both. The
  dataset carries its own DOI, listed under identifiers below.
type: software
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, containerised suite that evaluates the accessibility of the
  institutional portal of the Instituto Federal de Educação, Ciência e Tecnologia
  da Bahia against WCAG 2.2 level AA, using two mutually independent engines,
  axe-core and the IBM Equal Access Checker, on a desktop and a mobile viewport.
  The result data it produces is published separately as a citable dataset.
authors:
